---
import LetterTitle from '../components/LetterTitle.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { formatLocalPhone, telHref } from '../lib/format';
import { loadSite } from '../lib/site';

const { settings } = await loadSite();
const phone = settings.phones[0];
const UPDATED = '22 October 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy · Body Gallery Kasoa"
  description="How Body Gallery handles your personal information, including bookings on WhatsApp, health details and photos, under Ghana's Data Protection Act."
  settings={settings}
>
  <section class="wrap pt-32 pb-24 md:pt-40 md:pb-32">
    <LetterTitle text="Privacy" />
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">Last updated {UPDATED}</p>

    <div class="prose mt-12 md:mt-16">
      <p>
        {settings.businessName} ("we") is a spa and body-care studio at {settings.address.street},
        {settings.address.locality}, Ghana. This notice explains what personal information we handle
        through this website and when you book with us, and your rights under Ghana's Data
        Protection Act, 2012 (Act 843).
      </p>

      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>
        This website has no forms or accounts, uses no cookies and doesn't track you across other
        sites. Our hosting provider keeps standard technical logs, such as IP addresses and browser
        types, to keep the site secure and working. If we add visitor statistics later, they will be
        cookie-free and won't identify you, and we'll update this page first.
      </p>

      <h2>Booking on WhatsApp</h2>
      <p>
        When you tap a Book button, WhatsApp opens on your phone with a message ready for you to
        send. Nothing you type on this website is sent to us or stored by the website. If you send
        the message, WhatsApp (owned by Meta) carries it under its own privacy policy, and we
        receive your name, phone number and anything you choose to tell us. We use this only to
        arrange and manage your appointments.
      </p>

      <h2>Health information</h2>
      <p>
        For some treatments we ask about your health, medicines, allergies and skin history so we
        can treat you safely. This is sensitive information. We only ask for what we need, keep it
        private, and use it only for your care. We don't share it with anyone unless you ask us to
        or the law requires it.
      </p>

      <h2>Photos</h2>
      <p>
        We only take or use before-and-after photos with your written consent, and we'll tell you
        where they will appear, such as this website or our social media. You can withdraw your
        consent at any time. We'll remove the photo from this website within 48 hours and stop using
        it from then on.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep information</h2>
      <p>
        We keep booking messages and treatment records only for as long as we need them to look
        after you and meet our legal obligations, and then delete them.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under Act 843 you can ask us to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>show you the personal information we hold about you</li>
        <li>correct anything that's wrong</li>
        <li>delete your information</li>
        <li>stop using your information for a particular purpose</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To ask, message us on WhatsApp or call{' '}
        {phone && <a href={telHref(phone.e164)}>{formatLocalPhone(phone.e164)}</a>}. We'll reply as
        soon as we can.
      </p>

      <h2>Complaints</h2>
      <p>
        If you're unhappy with how we've handled your information, please tell us first so we can
        put it right. You can also complain to Ghana's Data Protection Commission.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this notice</h2>
      <p>If anything changes, we'll update this page and the date at the top.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
